  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c113c980277e1c3469477cf4de3cb671, type: 3}
  m_Name: Note_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemData
  itemName: 
  itemDescription: 'Date: Sept 21, 2026 | 13:05

    Re: "The Overgrowth"


    These plant creatures are multiplying. Since our first encounter on Sept 15th - when they took a coughing friend - workers keep vanishing. Some creatures even resemble them.


    They are blind, hunting only by light and sound. Avoid their pollen, or you will cough uncontrollably. HOLD YOUR BREATH.


    They camouflage perfectly into the aggressive plant growth tearing apart this two-year-old city. Initiate Corp sent my three-man team to investigate; buildings were already consumed by roots when we arrived. At this rate, the city will be a dense jungle in three months.


    As detailed in my Sept 19th note, I now know Initiate Corp caused this.


    - Spencer Dickens'
